   \[
   v = \left( \frac{v_0}{R} + \frac{a}{R} t \right) R = v_0 + at \quad \text{(4)}
   \]

From equation 1, we have \( v = v_0 + at \). From equation 4, we have \( v = v_0 + at \). Both equations are the same, which is consistent with the rolling without slipping condition.

