     - Carbon-16 (¹⁶C) with 12 protons and 4 neutrons.
     - Carbon-1⁶ (¹⁶C) with 12 protons and 5 neutrons.
     - Carbon-1⁶ (¹⁶C) with 12 protons and 7 neutrons.

