   \[
   6.00 \, \text{M} \times x + 1.00 \, \text{M} \times 10.0 \, \text{L} = 3.00 \, \text{M} \times 20.0 \, \text{L}
   \]

5. **Solve for } x \):  
   \[
   6.00x + 10.0 = 60.0
   \]
   \[
   6.00x = 50.0
   \]
   \[
   x = 50.0 / 6.00 = 7.5 \, \text{L}
   \]

