where \( \delta = \cos(\theta) \times \cos(\theta) \rightarrow \cos(\theta) \), and \( \Delta n = n - 1 \).  
For normal incidence (\(\theta = 0\)), \( \delta = 1 \), and \( \Delta n = 1.5 - 1 = 0.5 \).  
