- \(\gamma_f = \text{coefficient of friction}\)
- \(d_1 = d_2 = 4 \text{ m}\)
- \(v = \text{velocity of the water in the pipe}\)

For cast iron, the friction coefficient (\(\gamma_f\)) for water at 20°C is approximately 0.005 \text{ m/s}^2.

