The head loss due to friction (\(\Delta h\)) is given by:
\[
\Delta h = \frac{D_1 + D_2}{d_2} \times \frac{v^2}{2g} = \frac{\pi \times \gamma_f \cdot v^2}{2g} = \frac{1.0 \times 0.05 \times 0.122^2}{2 \times 9.9} \approx 0.00015 \text{ m}
\]

